---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
---

<ToolLayout
  title="Generator formatów niestandardowych Excel"
  description="Wybierz sposób wyświetlania liczby, waluty, procentu, daty, czasu lub jednostki, a generator przygotuje gotowy kod formatu niestandardowego do Excela."
  slug="generator-formatow"
  functionName="Formatowanie niestandardowe"
  functionHref="/formuly/"
  resourceLabel="Powiązany temat"
  resourceAction="Przejdź do formuł →"
>
  <div class="generator-intro">
    <span class="section-kicker">Generator formatu</span>
    <h2>Zbuduj format niestandardowy</h2>
    <p>Wybierz typ, ustaw szczegóły i skopiuj gotowy kod do pola <strong>Formatowanie komórek → Niestandardowe → Typ</strong>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="format-generator" data-format-generator>
    <div class="generator-grid">
      <div class="generator-field">
        <label for="fmt-type">Typ formatu</label>
        <select id="fmt-type" data-type>
          <option value="number">Liczba</option>
          <option value="currency">Waluta PLN</option>
          <option value="percent">Procent</option>
          <option value="unit">Liczba z jednostką</option>
          <option value="date">Data</option>
          <option value="elapsed">Czas powyżej 24 godzin</option>
          <option value="hidezero">Ukryj zera</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="generator-field" data-number-options>
        <label for="fmt-decimals">Miejsca dziesiętne</label>
        <select id="fmt-decimals" data-decimals>
          <option value="0">0</option>
          <option value="1">1</option>
          <option value="2" selected>2</option>
          <option value="3">3</option>
          <option value="4">4</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="generator-field" data-number-options>
        <label for="fmt-group">Separator tysięcy</label>
        <select id="fmt-group" data-group>
          <option value="yes">Tak</option>
          <option value="no">Nie</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="generator-field" data-number-options>
        <label for="fmt-negative">Liczby ujemne</label>
        <select id="fmt-negative" data-negative>
          <option value="minus">Z minusem</option>
          <option value="parentheses">W nawiasach</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="format-extra">
      <div class="generator-field hidden" data-unit-field>
        <label for="fmt-unit">Jednostka</label>
        <input id="fmt-unit" data-unit value="kg" spellcheck="false"/>
        <small>Tekst zostanie dodany w cudzysłowie, np. 125,50 kg.</small>
      </div>

      <div class="generator-field hidden" data-date-field>
        <label for="fmt-date-style">Wygląd daty</label>
        <select id="fmt-date-style" data-date-style>
          <option value="short">31.12.2026</option>
          <option value="month">31 grudnia 2026</option>
          <option value="weekday">czwartek, 31 grudnia 2026</option>
          <option value="monthyear">grudzień 2026</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="generator-field hidden" data-time-field>
        <label for="fmt-time-style">Wygląd czasu</label>
        <select id="fmt-time-style" data-time-style>
          <option value="hm">27:30</option>
          <option value="hms">27:30:15</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="generator-field" data-sample-number>
        <label for="fmt-sample">Wartość przykładowa</label>
        <input id="fmt-sample" data-sample type="number" step="0.01" value="12345.67"/>
      </div>

      <div class="generator-field hidden" data-sample-date>
        <label for="fmt-sample-date">Przykładowa data</label>
        <input id="fmt-sample-date" data-date-sample type="date" value="2026-12-31"/>
      </div>

      <div class="generator-field hidden" data-sample-hours>
        <label for="fmt-hours">Przykładowy czas w godzinach</label>
        <input id="fmt-hours" data-hours-sample type="number" min="0" step="0.25" value="27.5"/>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="format-preview">
      <span>Podgląd</span>
      <strong data-preview aria-live="polite">12 345,67</strong>
      <small>Podgląd pokazuje efekt dla wartości przykładowej.</small>
    </div>

    <div class="generator-output">
      <div>
        <span>Kod formatu</span>
        <small>Wklej w Excelu do pola Typ.</small>
      </div>
      <code data-format-code># ##0,00</code>
      <button type="button" data-copy>Kopiuj format</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="generator-help">
    <h2>Jak zastosować format?</h2>
    <p>Zaznacz komórki → naciśnij <strong>Ctrl+1</strong> → wybierz <strong>Niestandardowe</strong> → wklej kod do pola <strong>Typ</strong>. Format zmienia tylko sposób wyświetlania wartości, nie samą wartość w komórce.</p>
  </div>

  <script>
    const root = document.querySelector('[data-format-generator]');
    const type = root.querySelector('[data-type]');
    const decimals = root.querySelector('[data-decimals]');
    const group = root.querySelector('[data-group]');
    const negative = root.querySelector('[data-negative]');
    const unit = root.querySelector('[data-unit]');
    const dateStyle = root.querySelector('[data-date-style]');
    const timeStyle = root.querySelector('[data-time-style]');
    const sample = root.querySelector('[data-sample]');
    const dateSample = root.querySelector('[data-date-sample]');
    const hoursSample = root.querySelector('[data-hours-sample]');
    const preview = root.querySelector('[data-preview]');
    const code = root.querySelector('[data-format-code]');

    const numberOptions = root.querySelectorAll('[data-number-options]');
    const unitField = root.querySelector('[data-unit-field]');
    const dateField = root.querySelector('[data-date-field]');
    const timeField = root.querySelector('[data-time-field]');
    const sampleNumber = root.querySelector('[data-sample-number]');
    const sampleDate = root.querySelector('[data-sample-date]');
    const sampleHours = root.querySelector('[data-sample-hours]');

    const show = (element, visible) => element.classList.toggle('hidden', !visible);

    const quoteText = (value) => '"' + value.replaceAll('"', '""') + '"';

    const numericBase = () => {
      const places = Number(decimals.value);
      const integer = group.value === 'yes' ? '# ##0' : '0';
      return integer + (places > 0 ? ',' + '0'.repeat(places) : '');
    };

    const applyNegativeSection = (base) => {
      return negative.value === 'parentheses'
        ? base + ';(' + base + ')'
        : base;
    };

    const formatNumber = (value, places, useGrouping) =>
      new Intl.NumberFormat('pl-PL', {
        minimumFractionDigits: places,
        maximumFractionDigits: places,
        useGrouping
      }).format(value);

    const formatDatePreview = (value, style) => {
      if (!value) return '—';
      const [y,m,d] = value.split('-').map(Number);
      const date = new Date(Date.UTC(y,m-1,d));

      if (style === 'short') {
        return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('pl-PL',{
          day:'2-digit',month:'2-digit',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'
        }).format(date);
      }

      if (style === 'month') {
        return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('pl-PL',{
          day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'
        }).format(date);
      }

      if (style === 'weekday') {
        return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('pl-PL',{
          weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'
        }).format(date);
      }

      return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('pl-PL',{
        month:'long',year:'numeric',timeZone:'UTC'
      }).format(date);
    };

    const updateVisibility = () => {
      const current = type.value;
      const numeric = ['number','currency','percent','unit','hidezero'].includes(current);

      numberOptions.forEach((element) => show(element, numeric && current !== 'hidezero'));
      show(unitField, current === 'unit');
      show(dateField, current === 'date');
      show(timeField, current === 'elapsed');
      show(sampleNumber, numeric);
      show(sampleDate, current === 'date');
      show(sampleHours, current === 'elapsed');
    };

    const update = () => {
      updateVisibility();

      const current = type.value;
      const places = Number(decimals.value);
      const useGrouping = group.value === 'yes';
      const sampleValue = Number(sample.value || 0);
      let formatCode = '';
      let previewValue = '';

      if (current === 'number') {
        const base = numericBase();
        formatCode = applyNegativeSection(base);
        previewValue = formatNumber(sampleValue, places, useGrouping);
      }

      if (current === 'currency') {
        const base = numericBase() + ' "zł"';
        formatCode = negative.value === 'parentheses'
          ? base + ';(' + base + ')'
          : base;
        previewValue = formatNumber(sampleValue, places, useGrouping) + ' zł';
      }

      if (current === 'percent') {
        const base = (places > 0 ? '0,' + '0'.repeat(places) : '0') + '%';
        formatCode = applyNegativeSection(base);
        previewValue = formatNumber(sampleValue * 100, places, false) + '%';
      }

      if (current === 'unit') {
        const cleanUnit = unit.value.trim() || 'kg';
        const base = numericBase() + ' ' + quoteText(cleanUnit);
        formatCode = negative.value === 'parentheses'
          ? base + ';(' + base + ')'
          : base;
        previewValue = formatNumber(sampleValue, places, useGrouping) + ' ' + cleanUnit;
      }

      if (current === 'date') {
        const map = {
          short: 'dd.mm.rrrr',
          month: 'd mmmm rrrr',
          weekday: 'dddd, d mmmm rrrr',
          monthyear: 'mmmm rrrr'
        };
        formatCode = map[dateStyle.value];
        previewValue = formatDatePreview(dateSample.value, dateStyle.value);
      }

      if (current === 'elapsed') {
        formatCode = timeStyle.value === 'hms' ? '[g]:mm:ss' : '[g]:mm';
        const hours = Math.max(0, Number(hoursSample.value || 0));
        const totalSeconds = Math.round(hours * 3600);
        const h = Math.floor(totalSeconds / 3600);
        const m = Math.floor((totalSeconds % 3600) / 60);
        const s = totalSeconds % 60;
        previewValue = timeStyle.value === 'hms'
          ? `${h}:${String(m).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(s).padStart(2,'0')}`
          : `${h}:${String(m).padStart(2,'0')}`;
      }

      if (current === 'hidezero') {
        const base = '# ##0,00';
        formatCode = base + ';-' + base + ';;@';
        previewValue = sampleValue === 0
          ? '(puste)'
          : formatNumber(sampleValue, 2, true);
      }

      code.textContent = formatCode;
      preview.textContent = previewValue;
    };

    root.addEventListener('input', update);
    root.addEventListener('change', update);

    root.querySelector('[data-copy]').addEventListener('click', async (event) => {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code.textContent || '');
        event.currentTarget.textContent = 'Skopiowano ✓';
        setTimeout(() => event.currentTarget.textContent = 'Kopiuj format', 1500);
      } catch {
        event.currentTarget.textContent = 'Zaznacz ręcznie';
      }
    });

    update();
  </script>

  <div class="generator-help">
    <h2>Format zmienia wygląd, nie wartość</h2>
    <p>Format niestandardowy nie przelicza liczby i nie zamienia jej na tekst. W komórce nadal pozostaje ta sama wartość, zmienia się tylko sposób jej wyświetlania.</p>
    <p>To ważne przy walutach, procentach, datach i własnych jednostkach. Dzięki formatowi liczba może nadal uczestniczyć w obliczeniach, mimo że użytkownik widzi np. „1 250 zł” albo „12,5%”.</p>
    <p>Po wygenerowaniu kodu otwórz Formatowanie komórek → Niestandardowe i wklej go w pole typu. Jeżeli efekt nie odpowiada oczekiwaniom, wróć do generatora i zmień parametry zamiast ręcznie poprawiać długi kod.</p>
  </div>
</ToolLayout>
